 MACRO&Lab _SetDeviceName&Lab ldx #19+256*24 Jsl $e10000 Mend MACRO&Lab _PMGetUserName&Lab ldx #19+256*42 Jsl $E10000 Mend MACRO&Lab _PMGetZoneName&Lab ldx #19+256*7 Jsl $E10000 Mend MACRO&Lab _PMGetNetworkName&Lab ldx #19+256*43 Jsl $e10000 Mend MACRO&Lab _PrDevWrite&Lab ldx #19+256*30 Jsl $e10000 Mend MACRO&Lab _Appletalk &params&Lab ldx #<&params ldy #^&params jsl $e11014 Mend MACRO&Lab _Names &MyName bra Skip&SysCnt dc i1'$42' dc i1'L:&MyName' msb on dc c'&MyName' msb offSkip&SysCnt Anop Mend